# Title: Local Groups Discovery - Linux
# ID: 676381a6-15ca-4d73-a9c8-6a22e970b90d
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Ömer Günal, Alejandro Ortuno, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-11
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1069.001
# Description: Detects enumeration of local system groups. Adversaries may attempt to find local system groups and permission settings
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.executable:*/groups) OR ((process.executable:*/cat OR process.executable:*/ed OR process.executable:*/head OR process.executable:*/less OR process.executable:*/more OR process.executable:*/nano OR process.executable:*/tail OR process.executable:*/vi OR process.executable:*/vim) AND process.command_line:*/etc/group*))
